{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Match! The 12 CZ Wars&quot;, the 12 Zodiacs are personified as 12 unique Zodiac Maidens with distinct personalities and skills. When ancient primordial beasts suddenly invade, you must lead them to fight back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7a70be9de65cf9f3061005aea67c72a5.avif?t=1761556396\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Build a Synergized Team\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/50ff13a27bd5e732e2fc7343e062cfbf.avif?t=1761556396\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/956fab866c7a2609bdbcffdf0a445d96.poster.avif?t=1761556396\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/956fab866c7a2609bdbcffdf0a445d96.webm?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/956fab866c7a2609bdbcffdf0a445d96.mp4?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each run, choose 3 Zodiac Maidens. Pay attention to their Yin-Yang attributes \u2014 different combinations unlock unique magic artifacts. The right artifacts will double your efficiency!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Choose Your Path Wisely\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.poster.avif?t=1761556396\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.webm?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.mp4?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each floor\u2019s battle, selecting an event card will alert the floor\u2019s boss. Plan your route carefully: prepare before the boss fully notices you, or challenge it early for greater rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Manage Resources Strategically\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.poster.avif?t=1761556396\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.webm?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.mp4?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins and insights through battles and random events to upgrade your Maidens, unlock passive skills, and forge countless paths to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Diverse Combat Mechanics\u3011</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.poster.avif?t=1761556396\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.webm?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.mp4?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider positioning, Five Elements cycle (mutual promotion and restraint), attack/defense attributes, and passive counters. Move tiles to trigger match-3 combos, command Maidens, and crush foes with high-damage chains!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Humorous &amp; Referential Story\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover main quests, side stories, anecdotes, and Zodiac archives \u2014 tens of thousands of words filled with lore, easter eggs, and tributes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Epic Crossovers\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The 12 CZ&quot; will collaborate with other indie games. Will you meet beloved characters or even indie developers in the Maidens\u2019 world? Explore to find out!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400030?t=1761556396","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/a288eb041e92a81ac56411e80d5f0b05bb583113/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761556396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/f6c028a6b2d0ba23fc5b52082689db10fa372ccc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761556396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/f6c028a6b2d0ba23fc5b52082689db10fa372ccc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761556396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"