rtifacts. The right artifacts will double your efficiency!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Choose Your Path Wisely\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.poster.avif?t=1761556396\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.webm?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.mp4?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each floor\u2019s battle, selecting an event card will alert the floor\u2019s boss. Plan your route carefully: prepare before the boss fully notices you, or challenge it early for greater rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Manage Resources Strategically\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.poster.avif?t=1761556396\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.webm?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.mp4?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins and insights through battles and random events to upgrade your Maidens, unlock passive skills, and forge countless paths to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Diverse Combat Mechanics\u3011</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.poster.avif?t=1761556396\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.webm?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.mp4?t=1761556396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider positioning, Five Elements cycle (mutual promotion and restraint), attack/defense attributes, and passive counters. Move tiles to trigger match-3 combos, command Maidens, and crush foes with high-damage chains!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Humorous &amp; Referential Story\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover main quests, side stories, anecdotes, and Zodiac archives \u2014 tens of thousands of words filled with lore, easter eggs, and tributes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Epic Crossovers\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The 12 CZ&quot; will collaborate with other indie games. Will you meet beloved characters or even indie developers in the Maidens\u2019 world? Explore to find out!</p>","developers":["CorvusCorax Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/43d619d2233234a3e286e5ca0c47876d46e4331d/header.jpg?t=1761556396","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"copyright \u00a9 2025 CorvusCorax Studio","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3400030/1213367205